  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Interaction of Convective Organization and Monsoon Precipitation, Atmosphere, Surface and Sea (INCOMPASS)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Research and development activity contributing to the UK&#x2019;s strategy to address key development challenges.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This programme aims to improve understanding and prediction of the South Asian monsoon variability on all timescales. Accurate monsoon prediction is a vital societal challenge with over 1 billion people and their agriculture impacted by the monsoon rains.</narrative>
  </description>
